    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17688" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Fanum</span></b> , i, n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city in Umbria</i>,
				<i>on the Adriatic Sea</i>, <i>with a
				celebrated temple of Fortuna</i>, now <i>Fano</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C. 1, 11 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">called also Fanum Fortunae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					3, 14, 19, § 113</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tac. H. 3, 50</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Orell. 83</span></i> and 84; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">and Colonia Fanestris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					2, 9, 16</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 1, 6</span></i>; cf.
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 1535</span></i>;
			<i><span class="en">3143</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3969</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
